1
00:00:00,450 --> 00:00:02,290
Number nine doesn't exist.

2
00:00:02,290 --> 00:00:03,860
So why is it open?

3
00:00:03,810 --> 00:00:04,560
Great question.

4
00:00:04,560 --> 00:00:05,910
Let's never find out.

5
00:00:05,910 --> 00:00:06,560
That's Zip.

6
00:00:06,560 --> 00:00:07,500
He's a cat sign.

7
00:00:07,500 --> 00:00:08,910
He's also a coward.

8
00:00:08,810 --> 00:00:11,080
I'm fragile. It
says so on my box.

9
00:00:11,480 --> 00:00:13,670
Nine years ago, my
mother walked out.

10
00:00:13,670 --> 00:00:16,500
She left me her coat, and
one word in the glass.

11
00:00:16,500 --> 00:00:17,100
Wait.

12
00:00:17,290 --> 00:00:18,650
I'm done waiting.

13
00:00:19,950 --> 00:00:21,500
Mara. This is our shop.

14
00:00:21,600 --> 00:00:22,690
Backwards.

15
00:00:22,740 --> 00:00:24,780
Oh no. I look
terrible backwards.

16
00:00:25,080 --> 00:00:26,800
And then the lamp came on.

17
00:00:26,900 --> 00:00:28,410
Please tell me you did that.

18
00:00:28,700 --> 00:00:30,760
There was fresh
glass on the bench.

19
00:00:30,760 --> 00:00:31,700
Still warm.

20
00:00:32,210 --> 00:00:33,400
Don't. Don't what?

21
00:00:34,000 --> 00:00:34,970
Turn.

22
00:00:35,370 --> 00:00:35,610
Mara?

23
00:00:35,610 --> 00:00:37,300
Someone is sitting behind us.

24
00:00:37,510 --> 00:00:39,220
So of course, I turned.

25
00:00:40,210 --> 00:00:42,220
She was wearing
my mother's coat.
